# Raw screenshot captures (kept locally; cropped versions in screenshot/ are
# tracked). DDPM.Subagent.User_*.png has no directory prefix - these get
# pasted next to whatever doc referenced them (TODO.md's own folder included),
# not just into screenshot/, so it's intentionally unanchored to catch it
# wherever it lands.
screenshot/mstsc_*.jpg
# Intermediate captures of the landing card shots. Every FINAL one of them is
# already committed under landing/public/screenshots (hashes checked
# 2026-08-29: six match byte for byte, et-08-v3 is the shipped file, and -02
# and -07 are the earlier take), so what is unique to this folder is three
# dead drafts. Kept locally rather than deleted - there is nowhere else they
# belong and nothing is gained by throwing them away.
screenshot/new-screenShot/
DDPM.Subagent.User_*.png

